      "ref": 1,
      "quote": "For Spanish–English translation, use of the module led to an increase in accuracy of anaphor translation, but for Catalan–Italian it resulted in a slight decrease in the accuracy of resolution."
    },
    {
      "ref": 1,
      "quote": "It is important to note here that the results without anaphora resolution for Catalan–Italian, where all targeted anaphors by default are translated as singular, still showed an accuracy of 83.3%. This indicates that the test data was not evenly distributed in terms of the grammatical number of the antecedents of these anaphors."
    }
