  "status": "answer",
  "answer": "The apertium-anaphora module increased the accuracy of anaphor translation for Spanish–English by 25 percentage points (from 29.2% to 54.2%) [1], but resulted in a slight decrease in accuracy for Catalan–Italian, from 83.3% to 75.0% [1].",
