  "answer": "The baseline TatarTTS models were built using the TatarTTS corpus, which consists of 70 hours of transcribed speech from two speakers [1]. Baseline end-to-end TTS models were built and evaluated using the subjective mean opinion score (MOS) measure [3]. Separate TTS models were trained for each speaker, using A100 GPUs on an NVIDIA DGX server [4]. The models were trained on the dataset for 1,000 epochs per speaker [2].",
